==Rolling Stock==
* [[Okami Metro 25 series|25 series]] (6-car sets):
*: Introduced in 2014, these trains are mechanically similar to the 20 series used on the [[Tozai Line (Okami)|Tozai Line]] but feature a bright **canary yellow** band. They are known for their rapid acceleration, necessary for the short station intervals in the Namba and Daikokucho districts.

